 false, \\\"text\\\": [\\\"The **total headcount across all series is 70,843**. Examples include:\\\\n- **1895 \\\\u2013 CUSTOMS AND BORDER PROTECTION:** **27,650** staff, including **8,732** with **20+ years** of federal service\\\\n- **1896 \\\\u2013 BORDER PATROL ENFORCEMENT SERIES:** **22,464** staff, including **5,513** with **20+ years**\\\\n- **0401 \\\\u2013 GENERAL NATURAL RESOURCES MANAGEMENT AND BIOLOGICAL SCIENCES:** **2,833** staff, including **852** with **20+ years**\\\\n- **1801 \\\\u2013 GENERAL INSPECTION, INVESTIGATION, ENFORCEMENT, AND COMPLIANCE SERIES:** **2,247** staff, including **910** with **20+ years**\\\\n- **0301 \\\\u2013 MISCELLANEOUS ADMINISTRATION AND PROGRAM:** **2,017** staff, including **642** with **20+ years**\\\"]}\"}], \"toolUseId\": \"toolu_01K7CMedrEcYZchjT6iXLyDw\"}}]"
