ion\": \"For the August 1, 2026 employment snapshot, list every occupational series (series code and name) held by staff in the CBP component (subelement code HSBD), with the headcount in each series and the headcount with 20 or more years of federal service (length of service bucket 20+), ordered by headcount descending. Include all series, not only the largest ones, and give the total headcount across all series.\"}}}]"
            }
